diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 105a7c2..6e3b882 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -4,6 +4,9 @@ All notable changes to Gondolin are documented here.
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- Add `httpHooks.streamRequestBody` to stream request bodies (including chunked ones) into `onRequest` and upstream without buffering or `maxHttpBodyBytes`, per request.
+- Stream `Response`s returned by `onRequest` to the guest instead of buffering them, so they are no longer capped by `maxHttpResponseBodyBytes`. Responses without a `Content-Length` are now sent chunked to HTTP/1.1 clients.
+
 ## 0.12.0
 
 - Add `VM.getHostPid()` to allow callers to collect host-side process metrics of the VM runner. #114
